Hey the edits for invoices are working as we discussed this morning.
The creditsUsed will update the edited invoice’s amount values
The amount will update the edited invoice’s creditsUsed values

Both regenerate the invoice
both have no overage OR rolloverCredits applied.

Both can have discounts.

Two types of editing both line by line -

Here are two sample request bodies:

PUT
`/api/v1/invoices/{invoiceId}`

```{
    "editByCredit": true,
    "projects": [
        {
            "name": "test invoice",
            "number": "1123",
            "creditsUsed": 25
        },
        {
            "name": "test invoice 1",
            "number": "1124",
            "creditsUsed": 25
        },
        {
            "name": "test invoice 2",
            "number": "1125",
            "creditsUsed": 50
        }
    ]
}```
VS

```{
    "editByCredit": false,
    "projects": [
        {
            "name": "test invoice",
            "number": "1123",
            "amount": 50
        },
        {
            "name": "test invoice 1",
            "number": "1124",
            "amount": 50
        },
        {
            "name": "test invoice 2",
            "number": "1125",
            "amount": 40
        }                
    ]
}```

